39:10.360 --> 39:13.140
Or am I trapped in an interpretive attractor,

39:13.340 --> 39:18.120
stubbornly forcing every new piece of evidence to fit the narrow map I already believe in?

39:18.120 --> 39:19.720
It is a profound question.

39:19.980 --> 39:23.440
And honestly, studying this paper leads me to one final thought,

39:23.520 --> 39:26.440
something that isn't explicitly stated in Flyxion's text,

39:26.600 --> 39:30.240
but feels like a direct, undeniable consequence of this geometry.

39:30.560 --> 39:31.800
Oh, what is it?

